  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience the perfect fusion of classic style and modern performance with the ASICS GEL-1130. Paying homage to the ninth iteration of the GEL-1000 series, these retro runners repurpose the traditional materials of the GEL-KAYANO 14 with modern suede panelling for a fresh look and lasting support. The TRUSSTIC support system from the late 2000s enhances stability, while the GEL technology in the midsole offers superior cushioning and shock absorption for a smooth, comfortable ride. Turn heads and own the streets in the ASICS GEL-1130.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-1130 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh upper provides a breathable fit.</li> <li>Foam and Gel midsole ensures step-in comfort.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers traction.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Gel-1130 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Pink/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203B265-700</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41.4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:cente